      554.94,
      542.52,
      664.41
    ],
    "text": "THE Sri Lanka Ports Authority (hereinafter referred as \u2018SLPA\u2019) acting by virtue and in terms of powers vested under the Section 42A(1) of the Sri Lanka Ports Authority Act No. 51 of 1979 as amended by Sri Lanka Ports Authority (Amendment) Act No. 7 of 1984 hereby certifies that ABCC Phoenix Shipping (Pvt) Limited, (Company Registration No. PV 92715) incorporated under the laws of Sri Lanka having it\u2019s registered office at No. 56, St. Lucia\u2019s Street, Colombo 13, being the Shipping Agent of G P Shipping Services Ltd (Manning Agent) of Greenhill Road, Peterhead, AB42, ADQ, Scotland has refused, failed and/or neglected to pay the charges due to SLPA, as morefully described in the schedule appended to this certificate and the respective charges are now due and owing from the aforementioned ABCC Phoenix Shipping (Pvt) Limited, to the SLPA amounting to a sum of Sri Lankan Rupees Nine Million Eight Hundred Eighty Thousand Seven Hundred Forty Nine and Fifty Three cents. (Rs.9, 880,749.53) as at 31.12.2022.",
